# Copy to .env.local for local development (it is gitignored).
#
# RESEND_API_KEY — the key of the Resend account that sends the notification
# email for the contact form (/api/contatti) and the free analysis form
# (/api/analisi). The email is sent as "Adriatica — Sito Web <onboarding@resend.dev>"
# to the address in content/site.ts (contact.email), with the visitor's email
# as Reply-To. See lib/email.ts.
#
#   * With the key set: the form answers "ok" ONLY when Resend accepted the email.
#   * Without the key and NOT in production (next dev): the submission is logged
#     to the server console as "[email:dev-fallback]" and the form answers "ok",
#     so you can test the whole flow locally. Nothing is emailed.
#   * Without the key in PRODUCTION (next start / deployed): the form refuses to
#     confirm. The API answers 503, the visitor sees the error message with the
#     direct email address, and the reason is logged with console.error.
#     Set the key in the hosting environment variables before going live.
RESEND_API_KEY=
